---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for LuneAster Travel — how we handle your data and protect your privacy."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <span class="hero-tag">☽ Legal</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="lead">Last updated: August 6, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <!-- Short summary -->
      <div class="privacy-summary">
        <p>I only collect your email and travel information submitted from the custom-trip form.</p>
        <p>Your personal data will never be sold or shared with third-party organisations.</p>
        <p>All your private travel-related information is kept confidential.</p>
      </div>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        LuneAster Travel ("we", "us", or "our") operates luneastertravel.com (the "Site").
        We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal data.
      </p>
      <p>We do not directly collect or store personal information on this Site. We do not require account registration, and we do not ask for your name, email, or payment details when browsing our content.</p>
      <p>
        <strong>Custom Trip Form:</strong> If you submit the custom-trip inquiry form on our
        <a href="/custom-trip">Custom Trip</a> page, we collect your name, email address,
        travel dates, number of travelers, budget, destination preferences, and any notes
        you provide. This information is used solely to craft a personalised travel itinerary
        and reply to your inquiry. It is never sold or shared with third parties.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our digital products are sold through Gumroad, which has its own privacy policy.
        When you purchase a product, Gumroad handles your payment and personal data —
        we only receive your email address (if you opt in) to deliver product updates.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Cookies and Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>
        We use third-party services that may set cookies or collect data when you visit our Site:
      </p>
      <ul class="policy-list">
        <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — Site hosting and security. May set a <code>__cf_bm</code> cookie for bot management. Expires in 30 minutes.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> (if enabled) — Anonymous traffic analytics. Cookies include <code>_ga</code> and <code>_gid</code>.</li>
        <li><strong>Affiliate networks</strong> — Klook, Booking.com (via Awin), Travelpayouts, and Amazon Associates. When you click an affiliate link, these partners may set tracking cookies on your device to attribute referrals.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        You can control or disable cookies in your browser settings at any time.
        Disabling cookies will not prevent you from reading our content.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Affiliate Links Disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        This Site participates in affiliate marketing programs, including but not limited to
        Amazon Associates, Klook Affiliate, Travelpayouts, and Booking.com (via Awin).
        When you click an affiliate link and make a purchase, we may earn a commission
        at no additional cost to you. This does not influence which products we recommend.
      </p>
      <p>
        For full details, please see our <a href="/disclosure">Affiliate Disclosure</a> page.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Data Security</h2>
      <p>
        We do not store sensitive data such as passwords or credit card numbers on this Site.
        All transactions are processed by Gumroad, which uses industry-standard encryption (SSL/TLS).
        Our Site is served exclusively over HTTPS.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on your location (e.g., EU/EEA under GDPR, California under CCPA),
        you may have the right to:
      </p>
      <ul class="policy-list">
        <li>Request access to personal data held about you</li>
        <li>Request deletion of your personal data</li>
        <li>Opt out of the sale or sharing of your personal data</li>
        <li>Lodge a complaint with a data protection authority</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Since we do not directly collect personal data, most requests should be directed to
        the third-party services listed above. However, if you believe we hold data about you,
        contact us at <a href="mailto:luneaster17@gmail.com">luneaster17@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Our Site is not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal
        information from children. If you believe a child has provided us with personal data,
        please contact us and we will take steps to delete it.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on
        this page with an updated "Last updated" date. We encourage you to review this
        page periodically.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at
        <a href="mailto:luneaster17@gmail.com">luneaster17@gmail.com</a>
        or DM us on <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@lune.aster" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TikTok @lune.aster</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: 5rem 0 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-tag {
    display: block;
    color: var(--c-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--c-text-muted);
  }

  .container-narrow {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }

  p {
    color: var(--c-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  p a, li a {
    color: var(--c-accent-light);
  }

  code {
    background: var(--c-surface);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--c-accent);
  }

  .policy-list {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .policy-list li {
    color: var(--c-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .policy-list li strong {
    color: var(--c-text);
  }

  .privacy-summary {
    background: var(--c-surface);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--c-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .privacy-summary p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--c-text);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
